OL,3,GNEWSABlue plaque to honour gig
OL,4,Aboatbuilder's legacy
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe life and work of a Cornish
OL,7,Fboatbuilder is to be commemorated with
OL,8,Fa blue plaque.
OL,10,FRalph Bird built 29 gig boats during 21
OL,11,Fyears at his workshop on the banks of
OL,12,Fthe Carnon river near Devoran and was
OL,13,Finstrumental in the resurgence of gig
OL,14,Fracing after he began an annual race on
OL,15,Fthe Fal in 1981.
OL,17,FThe plaque was organised by the
OL,18,FRestronguet Creek Society and is due to
OL,19,Fbe unveiled later in a private ceremony
OL,20,Fattended by his widow Marie.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
