OL,3,GNEWSABlue plaque to honour gig
OL,4,Aboatbuilder's legacy
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 32ft long traditional clinker-built
OL,7,Fwooden boats were originally made at
OL,8,Fthe end of the 18th Century in Cornwall
OL,9,Fto take harbour pilots out to sailing
OL,10,Fships.
